        "projected": "14 nodes · 212 relationships → canvas"
      },
      "answer": {
        "text": "Found **14 airlines**. Lufthansa alone reaches 74 countries from Frankfurt; the next, Condor, 41. Added 14 nodes and 212 relationships to the canvas.",
